WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.979
Plans change. A member can leave a Popkin they no longer want.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.153
A member who is not the Host opens Popkin settings. Two choices: Invite people, and

00:00:13.153 --> 00:00:14.571
Leave this Popkin.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.886
Leave Lakeside Weekend? Your messages and photos stay. To come back, you'll need a

00:00:22.886 --> 00:00:23.842
new invite.

00:00:24.042 --> 00:00:27.075
Leave, or Stay. Stay is where the focus starts.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.349
Leave reads Leaving, while it goes through.

00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:36.327
Then My Popkins opens, and Lakeside Weekend is gone from it.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.844
Everyone still in it sees one member fewer, straight away. Fourteen members becomes

00:00:46.844 --> 00:00:47.669
thirteen.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.395
My Popkins uses the width it is given: one column on a phone, and more across as the

00:00:57.395 --> 00:00:58.530
screen grows.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.062
What no screen shows: the Host has no way to leave, even by hand. And once you have

00:01:07.062 --> 00:01:10.411
left, everything in the Popkin answers: not found.

00:01:10.611 --> 00:01:13.794
If leaving fails, the dialog says so, and you stay.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.847
That is journey eighteen. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
